[["heading","P RACTICAL PROJECT / PART 1\nPharmacy inventory test suite"],["sinhala","","Stock reserve කරන function එකකට valid සහ invalid cases ලියමු. Node.js built-in test runner එJකන්",487],["sinhala","","dependencies නැතුව run කරන්න පුළුවන්.",204],["text","Save as inventory.test.cjs. Assumption: stock is a valid nonnegative integer from the inventory\nsystem. The function is pure; no database is mutated."],["text","Stock + quantity\nValidate quantity\nCheck stock\nReturn remaining"],["code","const { test } = require('node:test');\nconst assert = require('node:assert/strict');\nfunction reserve(stock, qty) {\n  if (!Number.isInteger(qty) || qty < 1)\n    throw new Error('Invalid quantity');\n  if (qty > stock) throw new Error('Insufficient stock');\n  return stock - qty;\n}\ntest('valid order', () => assert.equal(reserve(5, 2), 3));\ntest('exact stock', () => assert.equal(reserve(5, 5), 0));\ntest('zero quantity', () => assert.throws(() => reserve(5, 0), /Invalid/));\ntest('excess quantity', () => assert.throws(() => reserve(5, 6), /Insufficient/));\ntest('fractional quantity', () => assert.throws(() => reserve(5, 1.5), /Invalid/));"],["text","Run: node --test inventory.test.cjs\nExpected: 5 passing tests, 0 failures."],["heading","Challenge"],["text","Add a negative quantity test and a test for zero stock. Explain why a pure function test is not enough to\nprevent simultaneous database reservations."]]